{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>ובחיקו ישא.</b> One who cannot walk." "<b>עלות.</b> They are the pregnant ones, upon whom the males will mount." "<b>ינהלם.</b> By implication [בלט]. And this is the meaning: that HaShem will gather the exiles and tend the broken."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:05.878534020Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}